 for dates on|before|after (value YYYY-MM-DD, after = on or after)|today|in_past|in_future|relative (value PAST_7_DAY, NEXT_2_WEEK, THIS_1_MONTH: DAY|WEEK|MONTH|YEAR)"},"required":false,"name":"filters","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Viewer's UTC offset in minutes (e.g. 120), for date filters on local days"},"required":false,"name":"tz","in":"query"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"All deals with contact/company info","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"deals":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Deal"}}},"required":["deals"]}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid filters","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"500":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/deals/progress":{"get":{"tags":["Deals"],"summary":"Open deals, worst first: each one's next step and the reasons to look at it","description":"An open deal is one whose stage is neither won nor lost. Its next step is the soonest of the next meeting booked with its company and its open tasks with a date (ours or theirs). Red: one of our promises is overdue, the last call went badly, a risk is open, or no next step and no contact in 14 days. Yellow: no next step, no contact in 14 days, waiting on them, the close date has passed, or the mood dropped. Contact is a call, an email, or a call, message, email or meeting logged on the deal, its company or its contacts; silence is judged only through what the CRM can see, and the reason says what it can't. Unknown: nothing against the deal and no way to judge contact.","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Viewer's UTC offset in minutes (e.g. 120), for what counts as overdue today"},"required":false,"name":"tz","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Default 100, max 500"},"required":false,"name":"limit","in":"query"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Open deals, worst first, then the biggest","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"deals":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Deal"}},"total":{"type":"integer"},"counts":{"type":"object","properties":{"red":{"type":"integer"},"yellow":{"type":"integer"},"unknown":{"type":"integer"},"green":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["red","yellow","unknown","green"]},"sight":{"type":"object","properties":{"calls":{"type":"string","enum":["seen","off","importing","failing"],"description":"seen: on and working; off; importing: the first import hasn't finished; failing: the latest run failed"},"emails":{"type":"string","enum":["seen","off","importing","failing"],"description":"seen: on and working; off; importing: the first import hasn't finished; failing: the latest run failed"}},"required":["calls","emails"],"description":"Whether the CRM can see calls and emails at all"}},"required":["deals","total","counts","sight"]}}}},"500":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/deals":{"get":{"tags":["Deals"],"summary":"List deals with pagination, search, and filtering","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Page number (default: 1)"},"required":false,"name":"page","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Items per page (default: 25, max: 100)"},"required":false,"name":"limit","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Column to sort by (any real column, incl. custom fields)"},"required":false,"name":"sort","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["asc","desc"],"description":"Sort direction (default: desc)"},"required":false,"name":"order","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Search term"},"required":false,"name":"search","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"JSON filter list, ANDed. Each entry is a rule {field, op, value} or a group {logic: \"and\"|\"or\", rules: [...]} (groups nest one level). op ∈ contains|does_not_contain|is|is_not (value may be an array)|is_empty|is_not_empty|gt|gte|lt|lte, and for dates on|before|after (value YYYY-MM-DD, after = on or after)|today|in_past|in_future|relative (value PAST_7_DAY, NEXT_2_WEEK, THIS_1_MONTH: DAY|WEEK|MONTH|YEAR)"},"required":false,"name":"filters","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Viewer's UTC offset in minutes (e.g. 120), for date filters on local days"},"required":false,"name":"tz","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Filter by stage key (see GET /api/stages for the pipeline vocabulary)"},"required":false,"name":"stage","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Filter by contact ID"},"required":false,"name":"contact_id","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Filter by company ID"},"required":false,"name":"company_id","in":"query"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Paginated deals","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"deals":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Deal"}},"total":{"type":"integer"},"page":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"},"totalValue":{"type":"number"}},"required":["deals","total","page","limit","totalValue"]}}}},"500":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["Deals"],"summary":"Create a new deal","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"contact_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"company_id":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The deal's company. Omitted, it is the contact's company"},"value":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"string"}]},"stage":{"type":"string"},"close_date":{"type":"string"},"notes":{"type":"string"},"custom":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["name"]}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Created deal","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"deal":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Deal"}},"required":["deal"]}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unknown field(s)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UnknownFields"}}}},"500":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/deals/{id}":{"put":{"tags":["Deals"],"summary":"Update a deal","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Resource ID (integer)"},"required":true,"name":"id","in":"path"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"contact_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"company_id":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The deal's company. Setting a contact on a deal without one also sets it, to the contact's company"},"value":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"string"}]},"stage":{"type":"string"},"close_date":{"type":"string"},"notes":{"type":"string"},"custom":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Updated deal","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"deal":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Deal"}},"required":["deal"]}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unknown field(s)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UnknownFields"}}}},"500":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["Deals"],"summary":"Delete a deal","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Resource ID (integer)"},"required":true,"name":"id","in":"path"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Ok"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid ID","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"500":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/tasks":{"get":{"tags":["Tasks"],"summary":"List tasks: open ones by due date (undated last), done ones newest first","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string"},"required":false,"name":"company_id","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"One deal's tasks: its own, and its company's that are on no deal"},"required":false,"name":"deal_id","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["open","done","all"],"description":"Default open"},"required":false,"name":"status","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["us","them"]},"required":false,"name":"owed_by","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Default 50, max 200"},"required":false,"name":"limit","in":"query"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Tasks","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tasks":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Task"}}},"required":["tasks"]}}}},"500":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["Tasks"],"summary":"Create a task","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"company_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"contact_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"deal_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"owed_by":{"type":"string","enum":["us","them"]},"due_date":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"YYYY-MM-DD, or null for none"}},"required":["title"]}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Created task","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"task":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Task"}},"required":["task"]}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"Not allowed","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/tasks/{id}":{"put":{"tags":["Tasks"],"summary":"Update a task, or mark it done (done: true) or open again (done: false)","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Resource ID (integer)"},"required":true,"name":"id","in":"path"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string"},"company_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"contact_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"deal_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"owed_by":{"type":"string","enum":["us","them"]},"due_date":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"YYYY-MM-DD, or null for none"},"done":{"type":"boolean"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Updated task","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"task":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Task"}},"required":["task"]}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"Not allowed","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["Tasks"],"summary":"Delete a task","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Resource ID (integer)"},"required":true,"name":"id","in":"path"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Deleted","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Ok"}}}},"403":{"description":"Not allowed","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/deals/{id}/updates":{"post":{"tags":["Deals"],"summary":"Log what happened on a deal, what it finished, and its next step","description":"One call for an update the CRM can't read on its own (a phone call, a message, an email from another inbox, a meeting moved or held in person, or a note). It goes on the deal's timeline at the time it happened. done_task_ids marks open tasks the update finished. next_step adds what happens next as a task on the deal, with its date and who owes it. close_date moves the expected close. A call, message, email or meeting counts as contact with the deal's company; a note does not. Move the stage with PUT /api/deals/{id}.","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Resource ID (integer)"},"required":true,"name":"id","in":"path"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["call","message","email","meeting","note"],"description":"call, message, email, meeting: contact with them. note: anything else worth keeping."},"summary":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":2000,"description":"What happened, in a sentence or two: who, and what was said or agreed"},"at":{"type":"string","description":"When it happened: ISO 8601, or YYYY-MM-DD. Default now. Never in the future: what will happen goes in next_step."},"done_task_ids":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":20,"description":"Open tasks of this deal (GET /api/tasks?deal_id=) that the update finished"},"next_step":{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":300},"due_date":{"type":"string","description":"YYYY-MM-DD"},"owed_by":{"type":"string","enum":["us","them"],"description":"Default us"}},"required":["title","due_date"],"description":"What happens next, by when, and who owes it: added as a task on the deal"},"close_date":{"type":"string","description":"YYYY-MM-DD, when the expected close moved"}},"required":["kind","summary"]}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Logged; the deal with its progress, and the next-step task","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"deal":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Deal"},"task":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Task"},{"type":["object","null"]}]}},"required":["deal","task"]}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"Not allowed","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/customers":{"get":{"tags":["Customers"],"summary":"How each customer is doing (worst first), what to do first, and calls with customers in the next 7 days","description":"A customer is a company with customer_since set. Red: one of our promises is overdue, the last call went badly, a risk is open, or no contact in 45 days. Yellow: no contact in 21 days, waiting on them, the mood dropped, a renewal within 30 days (or past), or no contact yet. Silence is judged only through what the CRM can see (calls when the meeting sync is on, emails when the email sync is on and has read the account's contacts), and the reason names what it can't see. Unknown: nothing else against the account and no channel to judge it by.","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Viewer's UTC offset in minutes (e.g. 120), for what counts as overdue today"},"required":false,"name":"tz","in":"query"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Customers","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"customers":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Customer"}},"focus":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["overdue","reach_out","renewal","due_today","risk"]},"company_id":{"type":"string"},"company_name":{"type":"string"},"text":{"type":"string"},"task_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["kind","company_id","company_name","text"]}},"upcoming":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"title":{"type":"string"},"starts_at":{"type":"string"},"company_id":{"type":"string"},"company_name":{"type":"string"},"company_domain":{"type":"string"},"ours_open":{"type":"integer"},"last_summary":{"type":["string","null"]}},"required":["id","title","starts_at","company_id","company_name","company_domain","ours_open","last_summary"]}},"counts":{"type":"object","properties":{"red":{"type":"integer"},"yellow":{"type":"integer"},"unknown":{"type":"integer"},"green":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["red","yellow","unknown","green"]},"sight":{"type":"object","properties":{"calls":{"type":"string","enum":["seen","off","importing","failing"],"description":"The meeting sync"},"emails":{"type":"string","enum":["seen","off","importing","failing"],"description":"The email sync"}},"required":["calls","emails"],"description":"Whether the CRM can see calls and emails at all"}},"required":["customers","focus","upcoming","counts","sight"]}}}},"500":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/lookup":{"get":{"tags":["Customers"],"summary":"What the CRM knows about an email address before someone writes to it","description":"The contact with exactly this address; their company (else the company on `domain`, else on the address's own domain when it is a work address), with customer_since when it is a customer; the company's and the contact's deals (open first, at most 10); the latest call with the company (a synced meeting, or a call or meeting logged by hand; emails are left out, since an app that sends logs its own sends here); and the next meeting booked. Nulls and an empty list when the CRM has never heard of them. Read only.","parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"The address, matched exactly (case aside)"},"required":false,"name":"email","in":"query"},{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"The company's domain, when the address is a personal one or the company is known by another domain"},"required":false,"name":"domain","in":"query"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"What the CRM knows","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Lookup"}}}},"400":{"description":"Neither email nor domain given","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"500":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["Customers"],"summary":"What the CRM knows about up to 100 addresses at once","description":"The answer GET /api/lookup gives, for each address in the order asked. For an app checking a batch of people before they join a campaign. An address with neither email nor domain gets an empty answer.","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"addresses":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"email":{"type":"string"},"domain":{"type":"string"}}},"minItems":1,"maxItems":100}},"required":["addresses"]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"One answer per address, in order","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"results":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Lookup"}}},"required":["results"]}}}},"400":{"description":"No addresses, or more than 100","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"500":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}}},"webhooks":{}}